{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object nearby, take it and process it. If not, move to random location and scan for objects. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectNearby    /> <Action ID = MoveToRandomLocation    /> <Condition ID = IsPathClear    /> <Action ID = ScanForObjects    />\"",
    "BT": {
